    },
    {
      "line_start": 199,
      "line_end": 200,
      "text": "Although Professor Lee gave his own avatar's output high scores, the project team felt self-evaluation is unreliable and that evaluation by others (e.g., his students) would be better. A Turing test was considered but deemed impractical.",
